; note: Pass start Inside: the inner edge of this area is an island wall, so each level starts with a cut of the full tool width along the island
; note: entry: Pass starts at Inside: the Plunge entry is used as selected, but Arc is recommended, because an Arc entry starts in the air outside the stock where it fits and never plunges into the material
